Milestone 014 — Private API Cache Loading

Implemented POST /accounting/load NDJSON ingestion endpoint that bulk-populates
the accounting cache without going through rate-limit / blocklist evaluation.

Components:
- internal/accounting/engine.go: Engine.BulkLoad + resolveEntity helper, four
  outcome constants (no_match, accepted_local, accepted_remote, dropped).
- internal/metrics/metrics.go: drl_accounting_bulk_load_total{result=...}.
- internal/api: AccountingBulkLoader + BulkLoadMetricsRecorder interfaces,
  handleAccountingLoad streaming NDJSON parser using bufio.Scanner +
  json.Unmarshal so malformed lines are counted but processing continues.
- internal/cmd/api.go: wires Engine as BulkLoader + Metrics into ServerConfig.
- README.md: documents the new endpoint and the bulk_load metric.

Tests:
- accounting: 6 BulkLoad scenarios incl. load-bearing
  TestEngine_BulkLoad_DoesNotEvaluateBlocking which proves the blocklist and
  broadcaster are NEVER touched, even when count exceeds rule.Limit.
- api: 8 handler tests covering auth, not-configured (404), happy-path
  outcome routing, distributionEnabled query parsing (true/false/invalid),
  malformed-line resilience, dropped outcome, and empty body.

Coverage: accounting 91.4%, api 94.5%. Lint clean.
